      "id": "71cef6d273d3-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "In which of the following states is the Sanchi Stupa UNESCO World Heritage Site located? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2366;&#2306;&#2330;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2370;&#2346; &#2351;&#2370;&#2344;&#2375;&#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2379; &#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357; &#2343;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2352; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2354; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In which of the following states is the Sanchi Stupa UNESCO World Heritage Site located?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2366;&#2306;&#2330;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2340;&#2370;&#2346; &#2351;&#2370;&#2344;&#2375;&#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2379; &#2357;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357; &#2343;&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2352; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2354; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Punjab &#2346;&#2306;&#2332;&#2366;&#2348;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Punjab</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2306;&#2332;&#2366;&#2348;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Bihar &#2348;&#2367;&#2361;&#2366;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Bihar</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2348;&#2367;&#2361;&#2366;&#2352;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Rajasthan &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rajasthan</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Madhya Pradesh &#2350;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2375;&#2358;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Madhya Pradesh</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2375;&#2358;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The <b>Sanchi Stupa</b> is a famous <b>Buddhist monument</b> and a <b>UNESCO World Heritage Site</b>, located in the <b>Raisen district of Madhya Pradesh</b>, near Bhopal.</p><p>&#183; It was originally commissioned by <b>Emperor Ashoka</b> in the 3rd century BCE.</p><p>&#183; It is one of the oldest stone structures in India and a key symbol of India's Buddhist heritage.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
