      "id": "71cef6d273d3-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "The Bidar Fort of Karnataka is irregularly ______ in shape. &#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2344;&#2366;&#2335;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2348;&#2368;&#2342;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; ______ &#2310;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Bidar Fort of Karnataka is irregularly ______ in shape.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2344;&#2366;&#2335;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2348;&#2368;&#2342;&#2352; &#2325;&#2367;&#2354;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; ______ &#2310;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Rhomboid &#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351;&#2327;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rhomboid</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351;&#2327;&#2381;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Circular &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2346;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Circular</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2346;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Rectangular &#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rectangular</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Square &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Square</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><b>Bidar Fort</b>, built in the 15th century by the Bahmani Sultanate, has an <b>irregular rhomboid shape</b>, adapting to the natural terrain of the Deccan plateau. Its layout includes seven gates and 37 bastions.</p><p><b>Further Insight:</b></p><p>The fort is a fine example of Persian-influenced architecture and houses structures like the Rangin Mahal and Gagan Mahal.</p>",
