      "question": "The Mysore palace was the residence of the _____. &#2350;&#2376;&#2360;&#2370;&#2352; &#2350;&#2361;&#2354; _____ &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2366;&#2360; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The Mysore palace was the residence of the _____.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2350;&#2376;&#2360;&#2370;&#2352; &#2350;&#2361;&#2354; _____ &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2366;&#2360; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Chandelas &#2330;&#2306;&#2342;&#2375;&#2354;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Chandelas</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2306;&#2342;&#2375;&#2354;</span>"
