      "question": "Alai-Darwaza, the southern gateway of the Quwwat-ul-Islam mosque in Delhi, was constructed by ______ &#2342;&#2367;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2369;&#2357;&#2381;&#2357;&#2340;-&#2313;&#2354;-&#2311;&#2360;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2350; &#2350;&#2360;&#2381;&#2332;&#2367;&#2342; &#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2339;&#2368; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352; &#2309;&#2354;&#2366;&#2312;-&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2332;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;&#2366;&#2339; ______ &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Alai-Darwaza, the southern gateway of the Quwwat-ul-Islam mosque in Delhi, was constructed by ______</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2354;&#2381;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2369;&#2357;&#2381;&#2357;&#2340;-&#2313;&#2354;-&#2311;&#2360;&#2381;&#2354;&#2366;&#2350; &#2350;&#2360;&#2381;&#2332;&#2367;&#2342; &#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2339;&#2368; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352; &#2309;&#2354;&#2366;&#2312;-&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2332;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2350;&#2366;&#2339; ______ &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Mu'izz ad-Din Muhammad Ghori &#2350;&#2369;&#2311;&#2332;&#2364; &#2309;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2368;&#2344; &#2350;&#2369;&#2361;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2342; &#2327;&#2380;&#2352;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Mu'izz ad-Din Muhammad Ghori</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2369;&#2311;&#2332;&#2364; &#2309;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2368;&#2344; &#2350;&#2369;&#2361;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2342; &#2327;&#2380;&#2352;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Ahmad Sh&#257;h Durrani &#2309;&#2361;&#2350;&#2342; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; &#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Ahmad Sh&#257;h Durrani</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2361;&#2350;&#2342; &#2358;&#2366;&#2361; &#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Ala-ud-din Khilji &#2309;&#2354;&#2366;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2368;&#2344; &#2326;&#2367;&#2354;&#2332;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Ala-ud-din Khilji</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2354;&#2366;-&#2313;&#2342;-&#2342;&#2368;&#2344; &#2326;&#2367;&#2354;&#2332;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Muhammad bin Tughlu &#2350;&#2369;&#2361;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2342; &#2348;&#2367;&#2344; &#2340;&#2369;&#2327;&#2354;&#2369;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Muhammad bin Tughlu</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2369;&#2361;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2342; &#2348;&#2367;&#2344; &#2340;&#2369;&#2327;&#2354;&#2369;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The Alai Darwaza was erected by <b>Ala-ud-Din Khalji,</b> a Sultan of Delhi (r.1296-1316) in c.1305 as the southern entrance gateway to the Quwwat-ul-Islam Mosque. The mosque is the earliest surviving in India and stands in the Qutb complex. The Alai Darwaza is thought to have been one of four gateways planned along the walls and is the only one surviving.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
