      "question": "Mahabalipuram temple was built under the reign of which of the following dynasties? &#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2348;&#2354;&#2368;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358; &#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2366;&#2360;&#2344;&#2325;&#2366;&#2354; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Mahabalipuram temple was built under the reign of which of the following dynasties?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2361;&#2366;&#2348;&#2354;&#2368;&#2346;&#2369;&#2352;&#2350; &#2350;&#2306;&#2342;&#2367;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2352;&#2366;&#2332;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358; &#2325;&#2375; &#2358;&#2366;&#2360;&#2344;&#2325;&#2366;&#2354; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2341;&#2366;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Rashtrakuta &#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2369;&#2335;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rashtrakuta</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2366;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2369;&#2335;</span>"
        },
