          "id": "B",
          "text": "Pratihara &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2361;&#2366;&#2352;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Pratihara</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2361;&#2366;&#2352;</span>"
        },
        {
